      "cooked": "<p>Here is my question,</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>first, i tried to find this question here in the forum with the search function (top right) - dindt get any results that makes me happy :D</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The wording on the golem Cards --&gt; \"Cant play during Unitys Play Phase\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Question:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What if a other hero play card with or an incap. Hero with the power:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"A Hero of your choice can play a Card now.\"</p><p>Let´s say, it should be Unity (suprise :) )</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Is it possible to play a golem WITHOUT destroying a card - because its NOT her Play Phase? Is Unity can play a card from her hand.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Is this correct?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thank you so much :D</p>",
